        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label"><text:p>활용 AI 툴</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label"><text:p>활용 AI 이름</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label"><text:p>사용한 명령어 (프롬프트)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p>※ 입력했던 명령어 요약 기재 (1,000자 내외)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label"><text:p>준수사항 동의</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="3"><text:p>본인은 ’2026 AI로 만드는 나만의 네컷만화 공모전’의 유의사항과 준수사항 등 제반규정을 숙지하였으며, 이를 준수하여 성실히 참가할 것에 동의합니다.</text:p><text:p>동의함 □  동의하지 않음 □</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p>2026 년　 월　 일</text:p><text:p>신청인 (대표자) : 성명　　　(서명)</text:p><text:p>서초1동주민자치위원장 귀하</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
      </table:table>
      <text:p text:style-name="PageStart">[초등 고학년부 · 시니어부] 서식 1</text:p>
      <text:p>※ 공모전 참가신청서는 최대 2페이지를 넘지 않게 작성</text:p>
      <text:p text:style-name="Title">2026 AI로 만드는 나만의 네컷만화 공모전 참가신청서</text:p>
      <table:table table:name="SeniorForm" table:style-name="FormTable">
        <table:table-column table:style-name="Col"/><table:table-column table:style-name="Col"/><table:table-column table:style-name="Col"/><table:table-column table:style-name="Col"/>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p>접수번호</text:p><text:p>※ 신청인은 작성하지 마세요</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label"><text:p>참가 자격</text:p><text:p>(모두 해당시 중복 체크)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>□ 서초구 거주</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label" table:number-rows-spanned="3"><text:p>참가자 정보</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label"><text:p>성명</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>□ 서초구 소재 초등학교 재학</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label"><text:p>주소</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label"><text:p>이메일</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label"><text:p>만화내용 요약문</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label"><text:p>스토리 제목</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label"><text:p>스토리텔링</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p>※ 만화 줄거리, 만화소개 등 설명 자유 기재 (1,000자 내외)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label"><text:p>활용 AI 툴</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label"><text:p>활용 AI 이름</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label"><text:p>사용한 명령어 (프롬프트)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p>※ 입력했던 명령어 요약 기재 (1,000자 내외)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label"><text:p>준수사항 동의</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="3"><text:p>본인은 ’2026 AI로 만드는 나만의 네컷만화 공모전’의 유의사항과 준수사항 등 제반규정을 숙지하였으며, 이를 준수하여 성실히 참가할 것에 동의합니다.</text:p><text:p>동의함 □  동의하지 않음 □</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p>2026 년　 월　 일</text:p><text:p>신청인 : 성명　　　 (서명)</text:p><text:p>서초1동주민자치위원장 귀하</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
